      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "The coordinator returns after enough replica\nacknowledgements satisfy the selected consistency\nlevel. It does not wait for an SSTable flush.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The coordinator returns after enough replica\nacknowledgements satisfy the selected consistency\nlevel. It does not wait for an SSTable flush.",
